{"title": "Lihala's Lute", "pageid": 12073, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lihala's_Lute", "categories": ["Musical Instruments", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Instrument_Lute2_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Instrument_Lute2_Icon.png/300px-Instrument_Lute2_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/1/1d/Instrument_Lute2_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Lihala's Lute image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Instrument_Lute2_Icon.png/300px-Instrument_Lute2_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Instrument_Lute2_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Lihala's Lute</span></a> is a unique <a href=\"/wiki/Instrument\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Instrument\">instrument</a>.  It can be played with the <a href=\"/wiki/Perform\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Perform\">Perform</a> action.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This lute's wooden body is worn dull from time and use, but its strings and frets are still in excellent condition.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Musical_Instruments\" title=\"Musical Instruments\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/25px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/38px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/50px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Musical Instruments\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png/25px-Musical_Instruments_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Musical_Instruments_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Musical_Instruments\" title=\"Musical Instruments\">Musical Instruments</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Require