=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">45a48cf7-baed-4d48-aaf4-1399948314e6</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:45a48cf7-baed-4d48-aaf4-1399948314e6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:45a48cf7-baed-4d48-aaf4-1399948314e6\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lute)\" title=\"Perform (Lute)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/60px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/80px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perform (Lute)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Lute_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Perform_Lute_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_(Lute)\" title=\"Perform (Lute)\">Perform (Lute)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;283&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;496</span>: Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> during conversation.</li>\n<li>Looted or pickpocketed from <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a>'s body.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Alfira gives this lute to the player if they agree to help her with her song. The player can choose to pocket it as soon as they receive it or perform with Alfira by passing a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Performance Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>.\n<ul><li>Helping Alfira finish the song also grants <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> in Musical Instruments.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"In-Game_Performance\">In-Game Performance</span></h2>\n<center>\n<figure class=\"embedvideo\" data-service=\"youtube\" data-mw-iframeconfig=\"{&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;height&quot;:225,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_vLTaJJfPjA?autoplay=1&quot;}\" style=\"width:400px\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper\" style=\"height:225px\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-consent\" data-show-privacy-notice=\"1\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader\" role=\"button\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Load video</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">YouTube</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice hidden\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__content\">YouTube might collect personal data. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/howyoutubeworks/user-settings/privacy/\" rel=\"nofollow,noopener\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__link\">Privacy Policy</a></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__buttons\">\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__continue\">Continue</button>\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"embedvideo-privacyNotice__dismiss\">Dismiss</button>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\t</div>\n</figure>\n\n<figure class=\"embedvideo\" data-service=\"youtube\" data-mw-iframeconfig=\"{&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;height&quot;:225,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Dd1M0f1EM2E?autoplay=1&quot;}\" style=\"width:400px\">\n\t<div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper\" style=\"height:225px\">\n\t\t<div class=\"embedvideo-